#9802
The Warp~
Wheee! this was a strange place. Not hot not cold. And
it looks like it is both day and night at the same moment.
You see moons and stars, suns and planets passing by
in an never ending stream. you see all the known and
many unknown constellations driving past in the sky. This
you realise must be some kind of transporting portal.
The only visible exits from here is south to a forrest glade
or north on a small dirt road trough a palmtree forrest.
